@allure.link:http://demo.cartzlink.com.local/admin/?r=orders/purchaseInvoice
@allure.label.owner:faheemanis
@allure.label.epic:purchase
Feature: Purchase Invoice

@critical
Scenario: Create Purchase Invoice
    Given we visit "orders/purchaseInvoice"
        and we click "Show/hide Form" button
        and we select "AA" in "customers_id"
        and we enter "100" in "cartage"
        and we load examples from "orders/Create Purchase Invoice"
        and we fill the grid with
              | DC | Products                                  | Rate | Qty | Disc. % | Disc. Amt. | Fixed Disc. | Amount |
              |    | CBCL162GOLD CBCL 162 Gold - 1PCS - 26581  | 100  | 5   | 0       | 0          | 0           |  500   |
    When we click "Save" button
    Then we should see success message
    and we should see this entry in grid:
        | customers_id  | currency_value |
        | AA            | 600            |

  Scenario: Edit Purchase Invoice
      Given we visit "orders/purchaseInvoice"
          when we edit the top row
          then we should see "AA" in "customers_id"
          then we should see "100" in "cartage"
          then we should see the following in grid:
              | DC | Products                                  | Rate | Qty | Disc. % | Disc. Amt. | Fixed Disc. | Amount |
              |    | CBCL162GOLD CBCL 162 Gold - 1PCS - 26581  | 100  | 5   | 0       | 0          | 0           |  500   |

  @critical
  Scenario: Update Purchase Invoice
      Given we visit "orders/purchaseInvoice"
          when we edit the top row 
          and we select "AK" in "customers_id"
          and we enter "200" in "cartage"
          and we fill the grid with:
              | DC | Products                                  | Rate | Qty  | Disc. % | Disc. Amt. | Fixed Disc. | Amount |
              |    | CBCL162GOLD CBCL 162 Gold - 1PCS - 26581  | 100  | 10   | 0       | 0          | 0           |  1000  |
 
    and we click "Save" button
    Then we should see success message
    and we should see this entry in grid:
        | customers_id  | currency_value |
        |  AK           | 1200           |

  @critical
  Scenario: Delete Purchase Invoice
      Given we visit "orders/purchaseInvoice"
      when we store the top row's DOC Id
          and we delete the top row
      then we should not see the stored Doc Id

